1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
潮汕的早晨，从一泡茶开始
In Chaoshan, morning begins with tea

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
一把小壶，三只小杯
One small pot, three small cups

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
摆成一个"品"字
Set into the character 品 — three mouths

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
它叫工夫茶——工夫，是耐心和讲究
It's called 工夫 tea — patience and care

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
不是武术，是把时间，花在一杯茶上
Not kung fu — time spent on a single cup

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
潮州工夫茶，是国家级非物质文化遗产
Chaozhou gongfu tea is national heritage

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
水要滚，茶要满，杯要烫
Water rolling, leaves heaped, cups warmed

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
每一克茶，只配二十毫升水
Each gram of tea, barely 20ml of water

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
所以茶很酽，也很讲究
So the brew runs strong — and exacting

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
连冲泡的手，都有名字
Even the pouring hands have names

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
第一招，关公巡城
First: Guan Yu patrols the city

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
壶口贴着杯，来回巡一圈
The spout hugs the cups, circling round

13
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
每杯的浓淡，就这样匀开
Evenly — no cup richer than the next

14
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,000
第二招，韩信点兵
Second: Han Xin counts his troops

15
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
最后几滴，一滴一杯，滴滴均分
The last drops — one to each cup, shared

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
一壶茶里，全是公平
A whole pot, poured for fairness

17
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
三只杯，敬天、敬地、敬人
Three cups — to heaven, earth, one another

18
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
主人最后喝，客人先请
The host drinks last; the guest goes first

19
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
潮汕人说：食茶
In Teochew they say 食茶 — "eat" your tea

20
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
也说：家己人
And they say 家己人 — you're one of us

21
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,000
苏轼写过：从来佳茗似佳人
Su Shi wrote: fine tea, like a fair lady

22
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,000
一杯茶的工夫，是待人的工夫
The 工夫 of tea is the 工夫 of welcome

23
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,000
得闲，来食茶
Free sometime? Come, sit, have tea

24
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,000
关注，带你读懂中国的慢
Follow — for the slow art of China
